            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Verify to continue</title><style>\n:root{color-scheme:light dark;--fg:#1b1b1f;--bg:#fafafa;--muted:#666;--line:#ddd;--accent:#2457d6;--warn:#b25e00}\n@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--fg:#e8e8ec;--bg:#151518;--muted:#9a9aa3;--line:#333;--accent:#7aa2ff;--warn:#ffb057}}\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg);background:var(--bg);margin:0 auto;max-width:880px;padding:16px}\nheader{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:8px}\nheader .host{color:var(--muted);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px}\na{color:var(--accent)} code{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%} td,th{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:4px 6px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:14px}\n.outcome{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}\n.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px} .warn{color:var(--warn)}\nform{margin:12px 0} label{display:block;margin:6px 0} input,button,textarea,select{font:inherit}\n.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px;margin:12px 0}\n.disabled{opacity:.5}\n</style></head>\n<body><header><strong>Verify to continue</strong><span class=\"host\">site-a.test</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><a href=\"/\">index</a></header>\n<p>Complete the check to read this article.</p>\n<form method=\"POST\" action=\"/__captcha/clear\" data-captcha><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"provider\" value=\"perimeterx\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"return_to\" value=\"/gated/article?mode=always&amp;style=widget&amp;provider=perimeterx\">\n<div id=\"px-captcha\" data-sitekey=\"testsite-fake\" data-testsite-fake=\"perimeterx\">\n  <iframe src=\"http://captcha.test/px-cdn.net/px-captcha/fake/captcha.html\" title=\"HUMAN / PerimeterX (test-site fake)\" width=\"304\" height=\"78\" style=\"border:1px solid #bbb;border-radius:4px\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"px-response\" value=\"\">\n</div>\n<script>\naddEventListener(\"message\", (e) => {\n  const d = e.data;\n  if (!d || d.type !== \"testsite-captcha\" || d.provider !== \"perimeterx\") return;\n  if (new URL(\"http://captcha.test/px-cdn.net/px-captcha/fake/captcha.html\").origin !== e.origin) return;\n  const f = document.querySelector('input[name=\"px-response\"]');\n  f.value = d.token;\n  \n});\n</script><button>Continue</button></form></body></html>"
